{"text": "MASSACHUSETTS INSTITUTE OF TECHNOLOGY\nDEPARTMENT OF CHEMISTRY\nCAMBRIDGE, MASSACHUSETTS 02139, U.S.A.\nRoom 2-121\n\nNovember 4, 1965\n\nDr. Robert C. Hockett\nAssociate Scientific Director\nThe Council for Tobacco Research, U.S.A.\n633 Third Avenue\nNew York, New York 10017\n\nDear Dr. Hockett:\n\nKerry Bowers and I have put through an application\nfor renewal of our TRC research grant, but because the paper-\nwork at MIT is sometimes slow I am sending you herewith an\nadvance (unofficial) copy.\n\nIt will be clear when you read it that the budget\nhas been increased noticeably above the figure we gave for the\nsecond year when we originally applied for a two year grant. The\nincrease is entirely out of our control and results from new\nMIT requirements, with respect to salaries and overhead, which\napply to all applications for new grants.\n\nWith best regards.\n\n\u2018ours sincerely,\n\nISW:bj\nEne.", "words": [{"text": "MASSACHUSETTS", "x0": 228, "y0": 88, "x1": 353, "y1": 99, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "INSTITUTE", "x0": 363, "y0": 88, "x1": 434, "y1": 99, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "OF", "x0": 443, "y0": 90, "x1": 461, "y1": 99, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "TECHNOLOGY", "x0": 470, "y0": 88, "x1": 569, "y1": 99, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "DEPARTMENT", "x0": 313, "y0": 111, "x1": 390, "y1": 119, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "OF", "x0": 396, "y0": 111, "x1": 411, "y1": 119, "conf": 94.0}, {"text": "CHEMISTRY", "x0": 417, "y0": 111, "x1": 483, "y1": 119, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "CAMBRIDGE,", "x0": 265, "y0": 129, "x1": 335, "y1": 137, "conf": 87.0}, {"text": "MASSACHUSETTS", "x0": 343, "y0": 129, "x1": 444, "y1": 137, "conf": 93.0}, {"text": "02139,", "x0": 451, "y0": 129, "x1": 486, "y1": 137, "conf": 92.0}, {"text": "U.S.A.", "x0": 495, "y0": 129, "x1": 531, "y1": 137, "conf": 74.0}, {"text": "Room", "x0": 353, "y0": 145, "x1": 384, "y1": 154, "conf": 88.0}, {"text": "2-121", "x0": 393, "y0": 145, "x1": 430, "y1": 154, "conf": 91.0}, {"text": "November", "x0": 399, "